.Dd October 30, 2026
.Dt NOD-DND 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm nod-dnd
.Nd control nod do not disturb mode
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Cm toggle | on | off | status
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
controls a running
.Xr nod 1
on the session D-Bus and prints the resulting state,
.Sq on
or
.Sq off .
The default command is
.Cm toggle .
Manual changes last until the next change in the configured schedule or until
.Nm nod
restarts.
The command requires
.Xr dbus-send 1 .
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr nod 1 ,
.Xr dbus-send 1
